# yanky's ring is a sqlite database under XDG_DATA_HOME, outside anything
# this harness isolates, and a real day-to-day yank history sits there
# already -- cleared first, so the frame shows only what this test yanked
# rather than history_length's worth of whatever was yanked for real.
# size: 100x24
ex:lua require("yanky.history").clear()
ex:edit app.py
keys:yy
ex:edit lib.lua
keys:yy
ex:edit README.md
keys:yy
keys:Space s y
